[2026-03-14T19:31:08.417Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CCVrGFXy7g8tyXNoTwbgMk","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now let me compile a comprehensive report. Let me create a summary document with all the findings:\n\n## Exploration Complete - Google Flights App Summary\n\nBased on my thorough exploration of the `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights` directory, here are my findings:\n\n### 1. App Directory Structure\n\n**Root Directory:**\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/` (Main application directory)\n\n**Key Subdirectories:**\n- `/src/` - Source code\n  - `/components/` - React components (31 components)\n  - `/pages/` - Page-level components (5 pages)\n  - `/slices/` - Redux slices (5 slices)\n  - `store.ts` - Redux store configuration\n  - `main.tsx` - Entry point\n  - `App.tsx` - Root App component\n- `/tests/` - Playwright test files\n- `/netlify/` - Netlify serverless functions\n- `/docs/` - Documentation\n- `/scripts/` - Build/test scripts\n- `/dist/` - Build output\n\n**Configuration Files:**\n- `package.json` - Dependencies and test scripts\n- `tsconfig.json` - TypeScript configuration\n- `playwright.config.ts` - Playwright test configuration\n- `vite.config.ts` - Vite build configuration\n- `netlify.toml` - Netlify configuration\n\n---\n\n### 2. PassengerCountSelector Component\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/PassengerCountSelector.tsx`\n\nKey Features:\n- Custom dropdown selector (not native HTML select)\n- Three passenger categories: Adults, Children (ages 2-11), Infants (under 2)\n- Redux state management via `searchSlice`\n- Validation rules:\n  - Adults: minimum 1, no maximum\n  - Children: minimum 0\n  - Infants: minimum 0, maximum = number of adults\n  - If adults decrease, infants are capped to adult count\n- Click-outside handler to close dropdown\n- Test IDs for Playwright testing:\n  - `passenger-count-selector`, `passenger-count-trigger`, `passenger-count-dropdown`\n  - `passenger-row-adults`, `passenger-row-children`, `passenger-row-infants`\n  - `adults-decrement`, `adults-count`, `adults-increment` (and similar for children/infants)\n\n---\n\n### 3. SearchButton Component\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/SearchButton.tsx`\n\nKey Features:\n- Validates all required search fields:\n  - Origin and destination airports\n  - Departure date\n  - Return date (only if trip type is 'round_trip')\n- Saves recent search to API via async thunk\n- Navigates to results page with URLSearchParams containing:\n  - origin, destination, departureDate, returnDate (if applicable)\n  - tripType, cabinClass, adults, children, infants\n- Redux dispatch for validation errors via `setValidationErrors`\n- Uses React Router navigation\n- Test ID: `search-button`\n\n---\n\n### 4. Existing Test Files\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/`\n\n**Test Files:**\n1. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/trip-type-selector.spec.ts` (110 lines)\n   - 7 tests for TripTypeSelector component\n   - Tests default selection, dropdown opening, option selection, closing behavior\n\n2. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/cabin-class-selector.spec.ts` (92 lines)\n   - 6 tests for CabinClassSelector component\n   - Tests all cabin class options and interaction patterns\n\nBoth use Playwright with Replay.io integration.\n\n---\n\n### 5. docs/tests.md - Test Specifications\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/docs/tests.md`\n\nComprehensive test specifications covering:\n\n**Search Page Components:**\n- TripTypeSelector (7 test cases)\n- PassengerCountSelector (8+ test cases detailed)\n- CabinClassSelector\n- AirportAutocomplete\n- DatePicker\n- SearchButton\n- RecentSearches\n- PopularDestinations\n\n**Key Test Cases for PassengerCountSelector:**\n- Displays default \"1 Adult\"\n- Opens dropdown with passenger categories\n- Increments/decrements adult count (minimum 1)\n- Increments/decrements children\n- Increments/decrements infants\n- Prevents infants exceeding adults\n- Closes dropdown when clicking outside\n- Updates total passenger display\n\n---\n\n### 6. playwright.config.ts\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/playwright.config.ts`\n\nConfiguration Details:\n- Test directory: `./tests`\n- Timeout: 60 seconds per test, 10 seconds for assertions\n- No parallel execution: `fullyParallel: false`, `workers: 1`\n- No retries: `retries: 0`\n- Browser: Chromium (via Replay.io)\n- Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n- Web server: `netlify dev --port 8888 --functions ./netlify/functions`\n- Server timeout: 30 seconds\n- Reporters: list and JSON output (`test-results/results.json`)\n\n---\n\n### 7. package.json - Test Scripts\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/package.json`\n\n**Available Scripts:**\n```json\n{\n  \"dev\": \"vite\",\n  \"build\": \"vite build\",\n  \"preview\": \"vite preview\",\n  \"check\": \"tsx scripts/check.ts\",\n  \"test\": \"tsx scripts/test.ts\",\n  \"deploy\": \"tsx scripts/deploy.ts\"\n}\n```\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- React 18.3.1\n- React DOM 18.3.1\n- Redux Toolkit 2.5.0\n- React Redux 9.2.0\n- React Router DOM 7.1.1\n- Netlify Functions 2.8.2\n\n**Dev Dependencies:**\n- Playwright 1.49.1 with Replay.io integration\n- Vite 6.0.5\n- TypeScript 5.7.2\n- ESLint with React plugins\n\n---\n\n### 8. Redux Store/Slices for Search/Flights\n\n**Main Store File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/store.ts`\n\n**Five Redux Slices:**\n\n#### searchSlice.ts\n- **State:** tripType, passengers, cabinClass, origin, destination, departureDate, returnDate, validationErrors\n- **Actions:** setTripType, setPassengers, setCabinClass, setOrigin, setDestination, swapAirports, setDepartureDate, setReturnDate, setValidationErrors, clearValidationErrors\n- **Async Thunks:** fetchRecentSearches, saveRecentSearch, fetchPopularDestinations\n- **Default:** 1 adult, economy, round_trip\n\n#### flightsSlice.ts\n- **State:** flights array, loading states, pagination (page, totalPages), sorting, filters (stops, airlines, price, duration, departure/arrival times), expanded flight legs\n- **Actions:** setSortBy, setStopsFilter, setAirlinesFilter, setPriceRange, setDurationRange, setDepartureTimeFilter, setArrivalTimeFilter, resetFilters\n- **Async Thunks:** searchFlights, loadMoreFlights, fetchFlightLegs, checkTrackedRoute, toggleTrackRoute\n- **Sort Options:** 'best', 'price', 'duration', 'departure', 'arrival'\n\n#### bookingSlice.ts\n- **State:** flight details, flight legs, passenger info, validation errors, booking status\n- **Actions:** initializePassengers, updatePassenger, setValidationErrors, resetBooking\n- **Async Thunks:** fetchFlightForBooking, createBooking\n- **Interfaces:** PassengerInfo, BookingFlightDetail\n\n#### tripsSlice.ts\n- **State:** bookings array, tracked routes array, active tab ('upcoming', 'past', 'tracked'), cancellation/untracking states\n- **Actions:** setActiveTab, clearCancelError\n- **Async Thunks:** fetchMyBookings, fetchTrackedRoutes, cancelBooking, untrackRoute\n\n#### exploreSlice.ts\n- **State:** origin airport, explore destinations, date prices, deals\n- **Actions:** setExploreOrigin, setDateRange\n- **Async Thunks:** fetchExploreDestinations, fetchExploreDates, fetchExploreDeals\n\n---\n\n### 9. SearchResultsPage Component (Results Page)\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/SearchResultsPage.tsx`\n\nKey Features:\n- **URL Parameters Handling:** origin, destination, departureDate, returnDate, tripType, cabinClass, adults, children, infants\n- **Components Used:**\n  - SearchSummaryBar\n  - FilterSidebar\n  - FlightResultCard (for each result)\n  - TrackPricesToggle\n  - Pagination\n- **Filtering & Sorting:**\n  - Client-side filtering (stops, airlines, price, duration, time filters)\n  - Sorting by: best, price, duration, departure, arrival times\n  - Dynamic price and duration ranges based on results\n- **Data Flow:**\n  - Dispatches `searchFlights` on mount/param change\n  - Dispatches `checkTrackedRoute` to check if route is being tracked\n  - Dispatches `loadMoreFlights` for pagination\n- **State Management:**\n  - Updates URL params when search criteria change (handleSearch callback)\n  - Maintains filter state in Redux\n  - Shows loading state, no results message, or results list\n- **Test IDs:** `search-results-page`, `results-count`, `results-loading`, `results-list`, `results-none`, `back-to-search`\n\n---\n\n### 10. Related Components\n\n**Other Key Components in `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/`:**\n\n- **TripTypeSelector.tsx** - Custom dropdown for round_trip, one_way, multi_city\n- **CabinClassSelector.tsx** - Custom dropdown for economy, premium_economy, business, first\n- **AirportAutocomplete.tsx** - Airport selection with autocomplete\n- **DatePicker.tsx** - Date selection component\n- **SearchSummaryBar.tsx** - Summary of current search params\n- **FilterSidebar.tsx** - Sidebar with filters for results\n- **FlightResultCard.tsx** - Individual flight result display\n- **TrackPricesToggle.tsx** - Toggle to track price changes\n- **Pagination.tsx** - Load more pagination\n- **RecentSearches.tsx** - Display user's recent searches\n- **PopularDestinations.tsx** - Display popular flight destinations\n- **FlightSummary.tsx** - Detailed flight information\n- **FlightDetailsPage.tsx** - Flight booking details page\n- **MyTripsPage.tsx** - User's bookings and tracked routes\n\n---\n\n### Summary of File Paths\n\n**Key Component Files:**\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/PassengerCountSelector.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/SearchButton.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TripTypeSelector.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/CabinClassSelector.tsx`\n\n**Redux Store:**\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/store.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/searchSlice.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/flightsSlice.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/bookingSlice.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slice